{"error": false, "page": 5, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 5, "recordCount": 411, "data": [{"docid2": 1677333, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202106/t20210623_1677333.htm", "content": "\n　　6月19日下午5点多，三明中燃公司生产运营部在安全隐患排查中发现江滨新村10幢边发现燃气泄漏，接到险情后，三明市煤气（三明中燃）公司运营党支部安全保供突击队立即奔赴现场。经检测，燃气泄漏量检测浓度为0%-", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202106/t20210623_1677333.htm", "docreltime": "2021.06.23 17:25:00", "doctitle": "三明市煤气（三明中燃）公司运营党支部 安全保供突击队昼夜奋战抢修燃气泄漏点", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842500, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202106/t20210623_1677333.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202106/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1675565, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202106/t20210618_1675565.htm", "content": "\n　　今年主汛期已经到来，在多场暴雨的连番夹击下，原水有可能突发高浊度水险情。为提高供水安全性，市城市公用集团在做好夏季高峰期供水的基础上，紧紧抓住“四项重点”，从五月下旬开始，采取切实可行措施，确保汛", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202106/t20210618_1675565.htm", "docreltime": "2021.06.18 09:09:00", "doctitle": "市城市公用集团：从“源头”到“龙头”保障汛期供水安全", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842536, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202106/t20210618_1675565.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202106/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1668199, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/t20210526_1668199.htm", "content": "\n　　日前，三明市特殊教育学校艺体楼及附属工程项目完成旧配电房转换室外新箱变关键节点施工，计划6月底完成项目艺体楼二次装修及室外景观工程。\n　　项目自2021年1月开工建设以来，市领导高度重视，多次深入现场办", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/t20210526_1668199.htm", "docreltime": "2021.05.26 16:38:00", "doctitle": "协助拆除旧配电房 拓宽民生“卡脖子”路段", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842529, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/t20210526_1668199.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1668192, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/t20210526_1668192.htm", "content": "\n　　 5月25日，副市长郑剑波带领市直有关单位负责人深入市区协调推进公交线路优化工作，察看了碧水蓝天、三明九中、碧湖、生态新城等公交枢纽站（首末站）和贵溪洋小溪路建设现场，详细了解场站周边交通秩序维护、场", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/t20210526_1668192.htm", "docreltime": "2021.05.26 16:36:00", "doctitle": "市政府领导现场协调推进市区公交线路优化工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842480, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/t20210526_1668192.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1667540, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/t20210525_1667540.htm", "content": "\n　　荆东片区是我市南部新城的重要组成部分，按照市委、市政府的决策部署，荆东片区将重点围绕三明学院及周边地块开发建设，打造产教融合示范区。5日17月，结合开展“再学习、再调研、再落实”活动，市委书记林兴禄", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/t20210525_1667540.htm", "docreltime": "2021.05.25 15:16:00", "doctitle": "市城市公用集团高效服务助力 荆东片区开发建设", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842535, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/t20210525_1667540.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202105/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1654873, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202104/t20210416_1654873.htm", "content": "\n　　“公交车什么时候来？”这是困扰泰宁人民群众和游客出行最普遍的问题。为进一步方便人民群众乘坐公交车，提高旅游城市形象，在泰宁县城主要路段投入使用12个新型智能公交电子站牌。  \n　　此次投入使用的电子站", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202104/t20210416_1654873.htm", "docreltime": "2021.04.16 15:48:00", "doctitle": "新型智能公交电子站牌在泰宁投入使用", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842528, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202104/t20210416_1654873.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202104/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1644494, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202103/t20210318_1644494.htm", "content": "\n　　2021年以来，三明市城市公用集团聚焦省委、市委“再学习、再调研、再落实”活动的决策部署，围绕做强做优做大国企工作大局，做实做足“四篇文章”，推进“四个着力”，深化“五比五晒”，铆足牛劲，汇聚牛力，紧", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202103/t20210318_1644494.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.18 08:22:00", "doctitle": "市城市公用集团：铆足牛劲，汇聚牛力，吹响项目攻坚新号角", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842534, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202103/t20210318_1644494.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1635905, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202102/t20210226_1635905.htm", "content": "\n　　近期发布的2021年中央一号文件提出：“实施乡村清洁能源建设工程。推进燃气下乡，支持建设安全可靠的乡村储气罐站和微管网供气系统”。《国务院关于新时代支持革命老区振兴发展的意见》也明确：“推动石油、天然", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202102/t20210226_1635905.htm", "docreltime": "2021.02.26 15:38:00", "doctitle": "三明中燃公司积极响应党中央实施乡村清洁能源建设工程，大力推进燃气下乡", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842499, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202102/t20210226_1635905.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202102/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1622396, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202101/t20210119_1622396.htm", "content": "\n　　近日, 南站片区市政路网——规划一路完成沥青路面摊铺、人行道铺贴、两侧绿化种植、路灯安装、沿河石质栏杆安装及道路交通标志性施划等。\n　　三明南站片区枢纽工程市政部分——规划一路起于工业南路，止于城关", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202101/t20210119_1622396.htm", "docreltime": "2021.01.19 16:04:00", "doctitle": "南站片区市政路网——规划一路基本完工", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842479, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202101/t20210119_1622396.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202101/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1591935, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202011/t20201119_1591935.htm", "content": "\n　　根据市委市政府推进荆东、槐林片区规划建设日程，市投资集团迅速响应，主动对接和启动两个片区的供水供气设施规划和建设，助力荆东、槐林片区开发。\n　　迅速响应。根据10月29日下午市领导督导荆东片区规划建设", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202011/t20201119_1591935.htm", "docreltime": "2020.11.19 10:28:00", "doctitle": "市投资集团积极推进供水供气设施建设，助推荆东、槐林片区开发", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842507, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202011/t20201119_1591935.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1574552, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政建设", "chnldocurl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202009/t20200929_1574552.htm", "content": "\n　　9月28日下午4：15左右，台江路5号20幢201室李先生 家中燃气灶蓝色火焰缓缓燃烧，三明中燃公司为台江片区首个居民用户点火通气。\n　　台江片区是市国资委、市投资集团落实市委市政府部署开展建成区天然气供应空白", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202009/t20200929_1574552.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.29 17:22:00", "doctitle": "多年“燃气”梦实现了！三明市区天然气空白点已全部消除", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842498, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202009/t20200929_1574552.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smsgzw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/ssqy/202009/", "rels": []}]}